      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "うちの常連のガストロって客なんだけど。\nぱたりとうちの店に来なくなってね。\nちょっと心配になっちまって……\n良ければ家まで見に行ってやっておくれよ。",
        "official_en": "We have a regular at the tavern named Gaston who\nsuddenly stopped coming. I'm a little worried...\nWould you go to his home and check on him?",
        "real_en": "We have a regular at the tavern named Gastro who\nsuddenly stopped coming. I'm a little worried...\nWould you go to his home and check on him?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
