      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ガストロのやつ。そんな杯を作ってたのか……\nとにかく無事で何よりさ。安心したよ。\n新しい杯は確かに売り上げが上がりそうだ。\n期待しておこうかしら。",
        "official_en": "That Gaston. So that's why he's been staying away!\nWhat's important is that he's safe. And it does sound\nlike those cups might well increase sales... We'll see.",
        "real_en": "That Gastro. So that's why he's been staying away!\nWhat's important is that he's safe. And it does sound\nlike those cups might well increase sales... We'll see."
